# regenerable Tesseract working files (keep action batches and notes)
**/.tesseract-work/*.schema.json
**/.tesseract-work/project.json
**/.tesseract-work/editable.json
**/.tesseract-work/checks/
**/.tesseract-work/frames/
**/.tesseract-work/*.log
# replica projects: the working folder is regenerated by build/build.py (renders, comparisons, schema dumps, base document)
01-tornado-replica/.tesseract-work/
__pycache__/
# the replica document is rebuilt from build/ + assets/ every round; committed only at milestones (git add -f)
01-tornado-replica/Replica.tsrct
01-tornado-replica/Replica.tsrct.tmp.tsrct
